[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 3.1.1 — Quickstep Android 17 Fix & 24/7 Activation Cloud[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Official Release Announcement & Download Links[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

Welcome to Expressive Launcher 3.1.1 (Build 43)! This release delivers critical compatibility updates for Android 17 Quickstep gestures, connects to our live 24/7 serverless activation cloud backend, and hardens recents gesture transitions.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New & Improved[/B][/SIZE]

1. [B]Android 17 Quickstep & QuickSwitch Support (Closes #24)[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Resolved a fatal [ICODE]NoSuchMethodError[/ICODE] ([ICODE]createInputConsumer[/ICODE]) in [ICODE]InputConsumerController.java[/ICODE], [ICODE]TouchInteractionService.java[/ICODE], and [ICODE]PipInputConsumer.java[/ICODE] when enabling Quickstep recents via QuickSwitch on Pixel 9 Pro and Android 17 devices.
[*]Replaced fragile platform interface assumptions with safe, multi-platform linkage guards ([ICODE]LinkageError | RemoteException | RuntimeException[/ICODE]) and safe input channel lifecycles.

[/LIST]
2. [B]24/7 Serverless Pro Activation Backend[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Deployed and synchronized our live global edge worker backend on Cloudflare Workers ([ICODE]https://expressive-pro-activation.daryldenson-apps.workers.dev/[/ICODE]).
[*]Seamlessly verifies PayPal contributions in real time with high-speed key-value storage. Tapping [B]"Check Payment Status"[/B] now retrieves and activates your Pro license in under 2 seconds worldwide—completely independent of local developer machines.

[/LIST]
3. [B]Multi-Window & Desktop Transition Stability[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Added null-safety guards in [ICODE]AbsSwipeUpHandler.java[/ICODE] for [ICODE]mRecentsView[/ICODE] during desktop windowing and swipe-up transitions.
[*]Prevents race conditions during rapid gesture cancellation or navigation mode switches.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]💎 Expressive Pro & Free Core[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Free Core (Always Supported & Ad-Free)[/B]:
[*]Clean, fluid Android 17 Pixel experience with 100% Pixel parity, private space support, and Google Discover feed integration via Expressive Feed Companion.
[*][B]Expressive Pro ($4.99 One-Time)[/B]:
[*]Unlocks deep personalization including custom grid sizing, typography, gesture mapping, dock styling, and per-app icon overrides.
[*][I]Expressive Pro is a one-time $4.99 contribution. Every dollar directly funds automated CI/CD servers, Android 17 test devices, cryptographic signing pipelines, and continuous active development.[/I]

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]😄 Launcher Humor[/B][/SIZE]

